  "text": [
    "Boat anglers were reporting successful salmon fishing trips.",
    "Mixed bags of Chinook salmon, coho salmon and some steelhead were caught.",
    "Most fish were caught on spoons, but a few big Chinook were caught on meat rigs.",
    "The most productive water seemed to be between 80 and 90 feet.",
    "Pier fishing was slow for all species, but there were a couple freshwater drum caught on live bait.",
    "Perch fishing was also reported as slow; however, the best water was south of the piers in around 30 feet of water."
  ],
